Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value LINK_STATUS (.+?)
Value PROTOCOL_STATUS (.+?)
Value HARDWARE_TYPE (.+?)
Value ADDRESS ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4})
Value BIA ([0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4}\.[0-9a-fA-F]{4})
Value DESCRIPTION (.+?)
Value IP_ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+/\d+)
Value MTU (\d+)
Value BW (\d+\s+\w+)
Value DUPLEX (.+?)
Value SPEED (.+?)

Start
  ^${INTERFACE} is ${LINK_STATUS}, line protocol is ${PROTOCOL_STATUS}
  ^\s+Hardware is ${HARDWARE_TYPE}(, address is ${ADDRESS}(?:\s+\(bia\s+${BIA}\))?)?
  ^\s+Description: ${DESCRIPTION}
  ^\s+Internet address is ${IP_ADDRESS}
  ^\s+MTU ${MTU} bytes, BW ${BW}
  ^\s+${DUPLEX}, ${SPEED}
